{"title": "Roart", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">398 Roart</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-images\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Preview\">Preview</div><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab\" data-druid=\"1-2\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Icon\">Icon</div><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab\" data-druid=\"1-3\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In space\">In space</div></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-files\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Preview\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:RoartPreView.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"RoartPreView.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/RoartPreView.png/250px-RoartPreView.png?1b38aa\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/RoartPreView.png/375px-RoartPreView.png?1b38aa 1.5x, /images/thumb/RoartPreView.png/500px-RoartPreView.png?1b38aa 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable\" data-druid=\"1-2\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Icon\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Roart_(Icon).png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Roart (Icon).png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Roart_%28Icon%29.png/250px-Roart_%28Icon%29.png?870fd6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"/images/Roart_%28Icon%29.png?870fd6 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable\" data-druid=\"1-3\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In space\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Roart_in_space.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Roart in space.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Roart_in_space.jpg/250px-Roart_in_space.jpg?9ea5b3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Roart_in_space.jpg/375px-Roart_in_space.jpg?9ea5b3 1.5x, /images/thumb/Roart_in_space.jpg/500px-Roart_in_space.jpg?9ea5b3 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-LevelInformation\">Level Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Price\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Price\">Price</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Price druid-data-nonempty\">\n&#9646;680</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-HazardLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-HazardLevel\">Hazard Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-HazardLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\nA</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SupportedWeather(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SupportedWeather(s)\">Supported Weather(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SupportedWeather(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nFlooded, Eclipsed, Earthquakes</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-TerrainforCruiser\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-TerrainforCruiser\">Terrain for Cruiser?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-TerrainforCruiser druid-data-nonempty\">\nNo</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Technical\">Technical</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorSizeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorSizeMultiplier\">Interior Size Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorSizeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1.4</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorsSpawnChances\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorsSpawnChances\">Interiors Spawn Chances</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorsSpawnChances druid-data-nonempty\">\nFacility: 0.73%<br />Mansion: 0.15%<br /><b>Atlantean Citadel: 87.36%</b><br />Carnival: 0.003%<br />Expanded Mineshaft: 8.74%<br />Greenhouse: 0.12%<br />Rubber Rooms: 2.91%</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MinimumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MinimumScrap\">Minimum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MinimumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n9</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaximumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaximumScrap\">Maximum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaximumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n12</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SpikeTraps\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SpikeTraps\">Spike Traps</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SpikeTraps druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 5</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Turrets\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Turrets\">Turrets</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Turrets druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 7</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Landmines\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Landmines\">Landmines</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Landmines druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 8</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Entities\">Entities</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Indoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantIndoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nHygrodere, Spore Lizard, Barber, Coil-Head, Bracken</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Outdoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantOutdoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nElder, Baboon Hawk, Feiopar</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DaytimePower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DaytimePower\">Daytime Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DaytimePower druid-data-nonempty\">\n9</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-ExteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-ExteriorPower\">Exterior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-ExteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n8</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorPower\">Interior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n11</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tocleft\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Map\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Map</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Info\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Info</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Environment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Environment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Weather\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Weather</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Inside_&amp;_Outside_Ambience\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inside &amp; Outside Ambience</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Outside_Ambience\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Outside Ambience</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Inside_Ambience\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inside Ambience</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Elder\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Elder</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Carnivorous_Roses\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Carnivorous Roses</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Trail:_Bury_The_Child\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trail: Bury The Child</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Progression\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Progression</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Unlocked_By\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocked By</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Unlocks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocks</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Loot_Table\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Loot Table</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Entities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Entities</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawn_Chances_(Interior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawn Chances (Interior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawn_Chances_(Exterior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawn Chances (Exterior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawn_Chances_(Daytime_Enemies)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawn Chances (Daytime Enemies)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-21\"><a href=\"#Bury_The_Child_Videotape\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bury The Child Videotape</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-22\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-23\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Deep within the forests of junic lay temples filled with gold. However they are well guarded, the elder does not take kind to intruders.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/File:RoartMap.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"RoartMap.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/RoartMap.jpg/650px-RoartMap.jpg?893698\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"650\" height=\"365\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/RoartMap.jpg/975px-RoartMap.jpg?893698 1.5x, /images/thumb/RoartMap.jpg/1300px-RoartMap.jpg?893698 2x\" data-file-width=\"1919\" data-file-height=\"1079\" /></a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> Moved<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> Dark, warm, moist, rich in diverse flora<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> Dominated by Baboon Hawks and Elders.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<div class=\"ambox\" style=\"--ambox-color: #0094FF;\"><div class=\"ambox-icon metadata\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/48px-Information.png?c7ec8d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/72px-Information.png?c7ec8d 1.5x, https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/96px-Information.png?c7ec8d 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"ambox-content\"><p class=\"ambox-title\">Unfinished Section</p><p class=\"ambox-text\">This section seems unfinished. If you're a wiki editor, please help with completing this section.</p></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Weather\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Weather\">&gt; Weather</span></h2>\n<p>Roart can experience Flooded, Eclipsed, or Earthquakes weather by default.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Inside_.26_Outside_Ambience\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inside_&amp;_Outside_Ambience\">Inside &amp; Outside Ambience</span></h3>\n<p>On Roart you can hear two ambiences. One plays inside while the other one plays outside.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Outside_Ambience\">Outside Ambience</span></h4>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"663\" data-mwtitle=\"Roart_outside.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Roart_outside.mp3?220ef3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Roart_outside.mp3/Roart_outside.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inside_Ambience\">Inside Ambience</span></h4>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"51\" data-mwtitle=\"Roart_inside_loop.wav\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Roart_inside_loop.wav?6ceecd\" type=\"audio/wav\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Roart_inside_loop.wav/Roart_inside_loop.wav.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Roart_inside_loop.wav/Roart_inside_loop.wav.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-transcodekey=\"mp3\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elder\">Elder</span></h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Elder\" title=\"Elder\"><b>Elder</b></a> is an entity that can exclusively spawn on the exterior of <b>Roart</b> during the day. It is a variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Forest_Keeper\">Forest Keeper</a> that is larger, louder, has a max count of 1, and has 80hp.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Carnivorous_Roses\">Carnivorous Roses</span></h3>\n<p>Roart's exterior has several small and large purple roses that temporarily trap any player that walks into them. The smaller roses deal 22 damage and the larger roses deal 90 damage to the player before releasing them. Several small roses also spawn in the interior.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trail:_Bury_The_Child\">Trail: Bury The Child</span></h3>\n<p>Roart features a trial that generates on the exterior. Completing it rewards the player with scrap worth \u25ae600-1000. The specific reward is <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span> a \"Soul orb\". </span></span><br /><br /><big>To complete this trial:</big>\n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Acquire four \"Human heart\" scrap. There is a very low chance for it to spawn within the interior, so the easiest ways to get multiple are through the gift shop on <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\">Galetry</a> or through the hidden chamber on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Thalasso\" title=\"Thalasso\">Thalasso</a>. This scrap is not to be confused with the vanilla \"Heart\" scrap that can randomly spawn within the interior of <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Dine\">Dine</a> in v73.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>From the back of and facing toward the ship, turn right, turn left, turn far right, turn left onto the path with purple roses, and continue straight until reaching the green lights with multiple altars.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Drop the hearts into the altars of blood as prompted.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Jump into the blue light to be teleported to an altered version of the exterior. Jumping back into the blue light teleports back to the regular exterior.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Turn right out of the altar area and follow the lights until reaching a stone platform.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Find Emma, who typically spawns in the nearby area, interact with her to retrieve her body, and place the body onto the top of the platform.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Emma will begin screaming and cause the entire area except for the stone platform to be covered in a thick fog that deals 1 damage per hit to any player inside. Interact with the blade.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Emma will begin to retaliate by summoning apparitions that deal 49 damage to the player on contact. Interact with the blade again.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Emma's apparitions will appear and move faster. Interact with the blade again.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>After successfully chopping off Emma's head, grab it and go to the map at the bottom of the stone platform to find the location to bury it. This location is marked by the shovel and an X, the map location is marked by the star, and the teleporter back to the regular exterior is circled with arrows pointing to it.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Interact with the mound surrounded by candles to bury Emma's head.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>After a short time, all players will be teleported back to regular exterior and the \"Soul orb\" scrap will spawn on the now closed off teleporter.</span></span><br /><br />On average, beating this trial requires <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>around \u25ae328 or more depending on how the hearts are acquired and rewards the player with around \u25ae800. It is possible to reach the altered exterior with a jetpack, but this is pointless because the four hearts must be dropped into the altar for the reward to spawn regardless of when the head is buried.</span></span></li></ol>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Completing the ritual and approaching the giant cubic skull found on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Junic\" title=\"Junic\">Junic</a>.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Dreck\" title=\"Dreck\"><big><b>Dreck:</b></big></a> Log \"Floppy disk\" that randomly spawns as scrap within the interior.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Scrap Items\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Floppy disk</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:(Lore)_Floppy_disk.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"(Lore) Floppy disk.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/%28Lore%29_Floppy_disk.png/60px-%28Lore%29_Floppy_disk.png?d9a47f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/%28Lore%29_Floppy_disk.png/90px-%28Lore%29_Floppy_disk.png?d9a47f 1.5x, /images/thumb/%28Lore%29_Floppy_disk.png/120px-%28Lore%29_Floppy_disk.png?d9a47f 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\