stained. We cannot allow the deceased to control who lives and who dies. Find the forsaken child, dispose of her body and we will let you out.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Trivia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Trivia\">&gt; Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Before <b>\"Obscurity\"</b> video material on \"Bury the child\" videotape was different:<br /><br /><video poster=\"/images/thumb/RoartTape.mp4/300px--RoartTape.mp4.jpg?832d69\" controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" class=\"thumbborder\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" data-durationhint=\"28\" data-mwtitle=\"RoartTape.mp4\" data-mwprovider=\"local\" style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:100%;height:100%\"><source src=\"/images/RoartTape.mp4?832d69\" type=\"video/mp4; codecs=&quot;avc1.42E01E, mp4a.40.2&quot;\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" /></video></li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:41px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.09.30.69.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Roart Fire Exit\"><img alt=\"Roart Fire Exit\" src=\"/images/thumb/Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.09.30.69.png/120px-Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.09.30.69.png?e54f84\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.09.30.69.png/180px-Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.09.30.69.png?e54f84 1.5x, /images/thumb/Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.09.30.69.png/240px-Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.09.30.69.png?e54f84 2x\" data-file-width=\"2560\" data-file-height=\"1440\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><center>Roart Fire Exit</center></div>\n